1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,488
To everyone watching,

2
00:00:01,488 --> 00:00:02,951
you'd freeze at the
edge.

3
00:00:03,401 --> 00:00:06,123
Friends far away would
watch you slow down.

4
00:00:06,123 --> 00:00:08,025
Then stop, just short of
the edge.

5
00:00:08,475 --> 00:00:10,582
That edge is the event
horizon.

6
00:00:10,582 --> 00:00:12,171
Point of no return.

7
00:00:12,171 --> 00:00:13,655
Not even light escapes.

8
00:00:14,105 --> 00:00:14,928
Why?

9
00:00:14,928 --> 00:00:17,626
Gravity bends space and
time so hard,

10
00:00:17,626 --> 00:00:19,686
your picture slows to a
stop.

11
00:00:20,136 --> 00:00:21,427
On your own clock,

12
00:00:21,427 --> 00:00:23,193
NASA's simulation has
the

13
00:00:23,193 --> 00:00:25,094
fall take about three
hours.

14
00:00:25,544 --> 00:00:28,880
A giant black hole,
about four million Suns.

15
00:00:28,880 --> 00:00:31,051
Like the one in our
galaxy's center.

16
00:00:31,501 --> 00:00:32,577
Cross the edge,

17
00:00:32,577 --> 00:00:35,671
and space itself rushes
inward at light speed.

18
00:00:36,121 --> 00:00:37,845
Then the simulation
gives you

19
00:00:37,845 --> 00:00:39,396
twelve point eight
seconds.

20
00:00:39,846 --> 00:00:42,314
The closer end of you
gets pulled harder.

21
00:00:42,314 --> 00:00:43,760
You stretch like a
noodle.

22
00:00:44,210 --> 00:00:46,797
Scientists really call
it spaghettification.

23
00:00:47,247 --> 00:00:49,170
A small black hole is
worse.

24
00:00:49,170 --> 00:00:51,362
It can tear you apart
before the edge.

25
00:00:51,812 --> 00:00:52,755
At the center,

26
00:00:52,755 --> 00:00:55,094
math says a point of
endless crush.

27
00:00:55,094 --> 00:00:56,845
Nobody knows if it's
real.

28
00:00:57,295 --> 00:00:58,375
The verdict?

29
00:00:58,375 --> 00:00:59,261
Unproven.

30
00:01:00,511 --> 00:01:02,772
Nothing from inside can
reach us.

31
00:01:02,772 --> 00:01:04,476
This is math, not a
memory.

32
00:01:04,926 --> 00:01:07,042
To the world, you'd
freeze at the edge.

33
00:01:07,042 --> 00:01:08,815
To you, you'd fall right
through.

